  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training-of-Trainers Poultry Sector Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During this project a group of eight professionals from Bangladesh active in the poultry sector will be trained for a period of two weeks in the Netherlands via a train-the-trainer approach.This will provide them the latest insights with respect to breeding and hatching, broiler and layer farm management and feed milling practices and improve their didactic skills, enabling the trainees to disseminate insights in their home market, contributing to the overall competitiveness of the livestock industry in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
